        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Deltana DSH4R5BM 4\" x 4\" x 5/8\" Radius, Bench Mark Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with doors manufactured by <b>Bench Mark</b>. Utilizes a special zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with <b>Benchmark Doors.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #10 x 1\" Wood Screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension Benchmark door spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH4R5-BM-specifications.gif?v=1704354646\" width=\"600\" height=\"274\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Benchmark Door Spring Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-x-5-8-radius-benchmark-door-hinges-pair-deltana-s44r5bms\"><b>4 Inch Benchmark Door Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" Benchmark Door Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li><b>Bench Mark Door Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</b></li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSH4R5BM.pdf?v=1704262280\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH4R5BM Benchmark Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different finishes for this Benchmark spring hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Durable Steel.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
